{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 10435224918840966518,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Python Developer's Guide",
      "source_hash": 10666995795476126426,
      "context_hash": 1704723508571137030,
      "translation": "Python 개발자 가이드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156173Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "This guide is a comprehensive resource for contributing to Python_ -- for both new and experienced contributors.",
      "source_hash": 16745393048428456476,
      "context_hash": 12831457519042099574,
      "translation": "이 가이드는 신규 기여자와 숙련된 기여자 모두를 위한 Python_\\ 기여 종합 자료입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156175Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "It is :ref:`maintained <devguide>` by the same community that maintains Python.",
      "source_hash": 9850844215181725739,
      "context_hash": 1380409845799968642,
      "translation": "이 가이드는 Python을 관리하는 바로 그 커뮤니티가 :ref:`관리합니다 <devguide>`.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156175Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "We welcome your contributions!",
      "source_hash": 6093872876119176850,
      "context_hash": 10109188457260410855,
      "translation": "여러분의 기여를 환영합니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156176Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Start with the area that best matches what you want to do.",
      "source_hash": 8102975054489983694,
      "context_hash": 7761246690405675558,
      "translation": "하고자 하는 일에 가장 잘 맞는 영역부터 시작하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156176Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "If you still have questions after reviewing the material in this guide, then the `Core Python Mentorship`_ group is available to help guide new contributors through the process.",
      "source_hash": 11199902368007878460,
      "context_hash": 11886682264431580165,
      "translation": "이 가이드의 자료를 검토한 후에도 질문이 있다면, `Core Python Mentorship`_ 그룹에서 신규 기여자가 이 과정을 밟을 수 있도록 안내해 드립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156176Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Documentation",
      "source_hash": 10013224844392777931,
      "context_hash": 4262654068638596183,
      "translation": "문서",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156176Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Code",
      "source_hash": 3030809606868828590,
      "context_hash": 3031529630413420992,
      "translation": "코드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156176Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Triage",
      "source_hash": 2011402686342710926,
      "context_hash": 5942289071926331372,
      "translation": "트리아지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triage": "트리아지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "We **recommend** that sections of this guide be read as needed.",
      "source_hash": 13941693890469261918,
      "context_hash": 9000860439988154692,
      "translation": "이 가이드의 각 절은 필요에 따라 읽을 것을 **권장합니다**.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "You can stop where you feel comfortable and begin contributing immediately without reading and understanding everything.",
      "source_hash": 17053408896078811122,
      "context_hash": 7184353999412229410,
      "translation": "충분히 이해했다고 느끼는 지점에서 멈추고, 모든 내용을 읽고 이해하지 않아도 즉시 기여를 시작할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:12/seg:2",
      "source": "If you do choose to skip around within the guide, be aware that some sections build on each other, so you may need to backtrack for missing concepts or terminology.",
      "source_hash": 2950137702769560665,
      "context_hash": 3565558868484369427,
      "translation": "가이드의 여러 부분을 건너뛰어 읽기로 했다면 일부 절은 서로 연계되어 있으므로, 빠뜨린 개념이나 용어를 확인하기 위해 앞부분으로 돌아가야 할 수도 있음을 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "For broader open-source contribution advice, a number of individuals from the Python community have contributed to a series of excellent guides at `Open Source Guides <https://opensource.guide/>`__.",
      "source_hash": 6982406069743727632,
      "context_hash": 9791753223806797939,
      "translation": "더 폭넓은 오픈 소스 기여에 관한 조언을 제공하기 위해 Python 커뮤니티의 여러 구성원이 `오픈 소스 가이드 <https://opensource.guide/>`__\\ 의 훌륭한 가이드 시리즈에 기여했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:13/seg:1",
      "source": "For example, `How to Contribute to Open Source <https://opensource.guide/how-to-contribute/>`__.",
      "source_hash": 13704319478617995993,
      "context_hash": 18256685010443935056,
      "translation": "예를 들어, `오픈 소스에 기여하는 방법 <https://opensource.guide/how-to-contribute/>`__\\ 입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T21:20:24.060352Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "You don't have to be a compiler engineer to work on Python -- Savannah Ostrowski",
      "source_hash": 14012233650177890068,
      "context_hash": 6233872285162037743,
      "translation": "Python 작업을 하기 위해 컴파일러 엔지니어일 필요는 없습니다 -- Savannah Ostrowski",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T21:20:24.060355Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Quick reference",
      "source_hash": 14773749448458472907,
      "context_hash": 411381408640075589,
      "translation": "빠른 참조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T21:20:24.060355Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The quick reference documentation has been moved to serve as a cheat-sheet and overview in :ref:`Getting started <getting-started>`.",
      "source_hash": 1708788941873383432,
      "context_hash": 15204529339287158001,
      "translation": "빠른 참조 문서는 :ref:`시작하기 <getting-started>`\\ 에서 치트 시트와 개요 역할을 하도록 이동되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156179Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Go to :ref:`the new quick reference <quick-reference>`.",
      "source_hash": 6121924699337545810,
      "context_hash": 18289676970777078545,
      "translation": "관련 :ref:`새로운 빠른 참조 <quick-reference>`\\ 로 이동하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156179Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Proposing changes to Python itself",
      "source_hash": 2430596653134538742,
      "context_hash": 6525686073098205168,
      "translation": "Python 자체에 변경 사항 제안하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156179Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Improving Python's code, documentation and tests are ongoing tasks that are never going to be \"finished\", as Python operates as part of an ever-evolving system of technology.",
      "source_hash": 11081552168644399115,
      "context_hash": 8815413210647128480,
      "translation": "Python은 끊임없이 발전하는 기술 시스템의 일부로 작동하므로 Python의 코드, 문서 및 테스트를 개선하는 작업은 결코 \"완료\"되지 않는 지속적인 과제입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "An even more challenging ongoing task than these necessary maintenance activities is finding ways to make Python, in the form of the standard library and the language definition, an even better tool in a developer's toolkit.",
      "source_hash": 1399650547105522258,
      "context_hash": 15984267163313354666,
      "translation": "이러한 필수 유지 관리 활동보다 훨씬 더 어려운 지속적인 과제는 표준 라이브러리와 언어 정의의 형태로 제공되는 Python을 개발자의 도구 모음에서 더욱 훌륭한 도구로 만드는 방법을 찾는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "standard library": "표준 라이브러리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "While these kinds of change are much rarer than those described above, they do happen and that process is also described as part of this guide:",
      "source_hash": 536751091240292079,
      "context_hash": 18150233286720164887,
      "translation": "이러한 종류의 변경은 위에서 설명한 변경보다 훨씬 드물지만 실제로 이루어지며, 그 과정 역시 이 가이드의 일부로 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:45:55.156181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
