    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Code of conduct",
      "source_hash": 8240219223058052529,
      "context_hash": 5047983826541177605,
      "translation": "행동 강령",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368681Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Please note that all interactions on `Python Software Foundation <https://www.python.org/psf-landing/>`__-supported infrastructure is `covered <https://www.python.org/psf/records/board/minutes/2014-01-06/#management-of-the-psfs-web-properties>`__ by the `PSF Code of Conduct <https://policies.python.org/python.org/code-of-conduct/>`__, which includes all infrastructure used in the development of Python itself (for example, Discourse, issue trackers, GitHub, and so on).",
      "source_hash": 8364901354202270231,
      "context_hash": 15753048773698937419,
      "translation": "`Python Software Foundation <https://www.python.org/psf-landing/>`__\\ 이 지원하는 인프라에서 이루어지는 모든 상호작용에는 `PSF 행동 강령 <https://policies.python.org/python.org/code-of-conduct/>`__\\ 이 `적용된다는 점 <https://www.python.org/psf/records/board/minutes/2014-01-06/#management-of-the-psfs-web-properties>`__\\ 에 유의하십시오. 여기에는 Python 자체의 개발에 사용되는 모든 인프라(예: Discourse, 이슈 추적기, GitHub 등)가 포함됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368682Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "In general this means everyone is expected to be open, considerate, and respectful of others no matter what their position is within the project.",
      "source_hash": 14513296835115888631,
      "context_hash": 16168071149527403963,
      "translation": "일반적으로 이는 프로젝트 내의 지위와 관계없이 모든 사람이 개방적이고 사려 깊으며 타인을 존중해야 한다는 의미입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368683Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Other interpreter implementations",
      "source_hash": 12463389631606869359,
      "context_hash": 14964264606029153408,
      "translation": "기타 인터프리터 구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interpreter": "인터프리터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368683Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This guide is specifically for contributing to the Python reference interpreter, also known as CPython (while most of the standard library is written in Python, the interpreter core is written in C and integrates most easily with the C and C++ ecosystems).",
      "source_hash": 5727018972092336370,
      "context_hash": 6364268253115677820,
      "translation": "이 가이드는 CPython이라고도 하는 Python 참조 인터프리터에 기여하기 위한 것입니다(표준 라이브러리의 대부분은 Python으로 작성되지만, 인터프리터 코어는 C로 작성되며 C 및 C++ 생태계와 가장 쉽게 통합됩니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interpreter": "인터프리터",
        "standard library": "표준 라이브러리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368685Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "There are other Python implementations, each with a different focus.",
      "source_hash": 17180554174595855369,
      "context_hash": 7272784171576292191,
      "translation": "각각 다른 부분에 중점을 둔 다른 Python 구현도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368686Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Like CPython, they always have more things they would like to do than they have developers to work on them.",
      "source_hash": 3476006039380848511,
      "context_hash": 1500932234547477757,
      "translation": "CPython과 마찬가지로, 이들에는 개발자가 작업할 수 있는 것보다 하고자 하는 일이 항상 더 많습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368686Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Some major examples that may be of interest are:",
      "source_hash": 12572917952229008133,
      "context_hash": 10358822553219247776,
      "translation": "관심을 가질 만한 주요 예는 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "PyPy_: A Python interpreter focused on high speed (JIT-compiled) operation on major platforms.",
      "source_hash": 8391495502444168269,
      "context_hash": 482210034692708898,
      "translation": "PyPy_: 주요 플랫폼에서 고속(JIT 컴파일) 실행에 중점을 둔 Python 인터프리터입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interpreter": "인터프리터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "GraalPy_: A Python interpreter which has first-class support for embedding in Java, built on GraalVM.",
      "source_hash": 15676523788968763970,
      "context_hash": 12380860233689596188,
      "translation": "GraalPy_: GraalVM을 기반으로 구축되었으며 Java에 임베딩하기 위한 일급 지원을 제공하는 Python 인터프리터입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interpreter": "인터프리터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Jython_: A Python interpreter focused on good integration with the Java Virtual Machine (JVM) environment.",
      "source_hash": 9847752617398239937,
      "context_hash": 8231383086148634303,
      "translation": "Jython_: Java 가상 머신(JVM) 환경과의 원활한 통합에 중점을 둔 Python 인터프리터입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interpreter": "인터프리터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "IronPython_: A Python interpreter focused on good integration with the Common Language Runtime (CLR) provided by .NET and Mono.",
      "source_hash": 7224750532888287197,
      "context_hash": 3000079113273347173,
      "translation": "IronPython_: .NET과 Mono가 제공하는 공용 언어 런타임(CLR)과의 원활한 통합에 중점을 둔 Python 인터프리터입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interpreter": "인터프리터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "MicroPython_: A tiny Python interpreter with small subset of the Python standard library that is optimised to run on microcontrollers and in constrained environments.",
      "source_hash": 2951267089106380540,
      "context_hash": 11468681615769130856,
      "translation": "MicroPython_: 마이크로컨트롤러와 제약이 있는 환경에서 실행하도록 최적화되었으며 Python 표준 라이브러리의 일부만 포함하는 소형 Python 인터프리터입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interpreter": "인터프리터",
        "standard library": "표준 라이브러리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "CircuitPython_: A fork of MicroPython designed to simplify experimenting and learning to code on low-cost microcontroller boards.",
      "source_hash": 5689904219752017043,
      "context_hash": 12697610971185344805,
      "translation": "CircuitPython_: 저비용 마이크로컨트롤러 보드에서 실험하고 코딩을 배우는 과정을 단순화하도록 설계된 MicroPython의 포크입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-30T20:44:43.368690Z",
      "issues": []
    },
